&& $\boxed{\text{ $2$ complex conjugate roots }}$  \\ \hline
$\Delta< 0$ with $k ∈ \{ ±1, ±3 \}$,& $\boxed{\text{ $2$ real roots and }}$ \\
&& $\boxed{\text{ $2$ complex (possibly coinciding) roots }}$ \\ \hline
\end{tabular}
